## Purpose

Move Tool Shed-generated work collateral from path-bound Markdown authority into the existing
embedded SQLite authority without losing content, identity, relationships, history, recovery, or
Codex's efficient file-shaped workflow. Give operators a concise lifecycle-organized tree while
making every generated view disposable and every durable relationship ID-based.

